commit 5fc238c3d448f836939f75181a904eb5ae1c99dd
Author: Falconiere Barbosa <falconieer@gmail.com>
Date:   Thu Jun 18 03:48:37 2026 -0300

    feat(design): add design plugin with stack-aware design-review skill
    
    New `design` plugin — web & mobile UI/UX design review over a cited,
    research-verified knowledge base.
    
    - detect-stack.sh: portable stack detector (JSON output, --no-jq pure-bash
      fallback, guarded under set -euo pipefail, exit 0 on unknown stack, exit 2
      only on bad usage). Published via a SessionStart symlink, like jira.
    - design-review skill: reviews source files / a served URL (static, Phase 1)
      against the knowledge base, scoped to the detected platform; emits cited
      findings + a verdict. Unknown-stack fallback skips platform-fit.
    - references/: 7 primary-source docs (NN/g, WCAG 2.2, Material 3, Apple HIG,
      MDN) — principles, ux-usability, accessibility, responsive, motion,
      platform-web, platform-mobile.
    - Tests: 8 bats over REAL OSS manifests (next-learn, flutter/samples, expo)
      + PROVENANCE; design-review trigger evals at precision/recall 1.0.
    - Registered in marketplace.json, package.json (pi.skills),
      release-please-config.json, and README.
    
    Phase 1 of a planned multi-skill plugin; design-generate / design-from-source
    / design-system and screenshot review are deferred to Phase 2.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>

